u want to save me, why don't you just let me go?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":9,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I said I will."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But not now. Right now, I want to see the real you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Morridow blinks. She opens her mouth to say something, but in the end, she decides to remain silent."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Your \"Father\" has been tormenting people and turning them into abominations that are neither alive nor dead, just to find individuals who are partially immune to Collapse radiation."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Unfortunately, it is all in vain."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...This is Paradeus' purpose, Nimogen."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We are blazing a trail into a new era... just as our name implies."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We are guiding ignorant humans to the land of true gospel."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NytoIsomer","expression":12,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"